  "text": "Zapier just launched conversational AI bots that control your existing apps. Business owners spend hours clicking through dashboards just to update lead statuses and assign sales follow-ups. Rigid if-then recipes break whenever incoming prospect data uses slightly irregular phrasing or unexpected formatting. Zapier Central lets you train autonomous bots to read spreadsheets, draft emails, and trigger actions using plain conversation. This turns multi-app chaos into hands-free revenue operations.",
